C.5.2. {"problem": "The Question object's description says it is 'for the owner to answer', and its confirmed source is the owner-only interview line. The expert can now ask questions, so the description no longer holds. The Question object's rationale also does not cover expert-originated questions.", "where": "authoring.domain.yaml, objects.Question.description", "kind": "reference", "from": "llm"}
